+# Plan
+
+## 1. Tests
+
+- [ ] 1.1 Snapshot code frames for a numeric start and a line/column start, at column 0 and inside a line (packages/vite/src/node/__tests__/utils.spec.ts) [AC-1]
+- [ ] 1.2 Snapshot a code frame for a CRLF source (packages/vite/src/node/__tests__/utils.spec.ts) [AC-2]
+- [ ] 1.3 Snapshot code frames with an end offset on the same line and on the next line (packages/vite/src/node/__tests__/utils.spec.ts) [AC-3]
+
+## 2. Fix
+
+- [ ] 2.1 Count each line's newline after the start check, so a column 0 start stays on its own line (packages/vite/src/node/utils.ts)
+- [ ] 2.2 Accept a line/column position for the end of the frame (packages/vite/src/node/utils.ts)
+- [ ] 2.3 Pass the end position from postcss warnings, parse5 errors and dynamic import warnings (packages/vite/src/node/plugins/css.ts, packages/vite/src/node/plugins/html.ts, packages/vite/src/node/plugins/importAnalysis.ts)
+- [ ] 2.4 Pass the esbuild message location to the code frame directly (packages/vite/src/node/plugins/esbuild.ts)
